WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.848
NIST SP 800-53 organizes controls into families.

00:00:03.848 --> 00:00:08.450
A control family groups related requirements and capabilities so the catalog is easier to

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.335
navigate.

00:00:09.335 --> 00:00:13.640
Examples include Access Control, Audit and Accountability, Configuration Management,

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.820
Incident Response, Risk Assessment, System and Communications Protection,

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.860
and System and Information Integrity.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.480
Other families address topics such as awareness and training, contingency planning,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.280
identification and authentication, planning, privacy, personnel security,

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.180
and supply chain risk management.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.840
Grouping controls into families helps organizations understand how safeguards relate to

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.310
different areas of security and privacy management.
